{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmik Storm is a fast-paced single player FPS and space shooter where you take the role of Earth's last surviving space marine. You must engage in epic space battles, navigate asteroid fields and infiltrate enemy bases on foot to prevent the robot army  from wiping out humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments and Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With elements of the environment procedurally generated, no two playthroughs are the same. Destructible voxel based environments add a tactical layer to combat. Blast through walls or create new paths to outmanoeuvre enemies and change the battlefield in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/69db785dc0c466dcf00116ea42c5502b.poster.avif?t=1764278695\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/69db785dc0c466dcf00116ea42c5502b.webm?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/69db785dc0c466dcf00116ea42c5502b.mp4?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engine Tech</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is powered by a custom ray tracing engine designed for fully dynamic lighting with pixel perfect shadows, reflections, and transparency. Combined with the destructible block-based environments, it creates a fully dynamic\u00a0 and visually stunning experience. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/a438bec2959ac3b20af0483229aefa90.poster.avif?t=1764278695\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/a438bec2959ac3b20af0483229aefa90.webm?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/a438bec2959ac3b20af0483229aefa90.mp4?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Asteroids</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated asteroids with labyrinthine tunnel systems and use them to infiltrate and escape enemy asteroid bases.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/8be114c2a042aa5b0ff08331934e7399.poster.avif?t=1764278695\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/8be114c2a042aa5b0ff08331934e7399.webm?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/8be114c2a042aa5b0ff08331934e7399.mp4?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Space Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space combat uses realistic Newtonian physics, with thrust, mass, and momentum shaping every manoeuvre. Thanks to the voxel-based design, enemy ships break apart realistically\u2014hit the hull and sections can shatter or detach during combat.  Switch seamlessly between controlling your ship and jetpacking towards an enemy base. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/d175ce1c1fb17ec7b726c0a427aba964.poster.avif?t=1764278695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/d175ce1c1fb17ec7b726c0a427aba964.webm?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/d175ce1c1fb17ec7b726c0a427aba964.mp4?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3462820?t=1764278695","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3462820?t=1764278695","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/e3376ce7284b3d1017ccc4140c843fbaa42b8cc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764278695","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/e3376ce7284b3d1017ccc4140c843fbaa42b8cc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764278695","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmik Storm is a fast-paced single player FPS and space shooter where you take the role of Earth's last surviving space marine. You must engage in epic space battles, navigate asteroid fields and infiltrate enemy bases on foot to prevent the robot army  from wiping out humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments and Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With elements of the environment procedurally generated, no two playthroughs are the same. Destructible voxel based environments add a tactical layer to combat. Blast through walls or create new paths to outmanoeuvre enemies and change the battlefield in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/69db785dc0c466dcf00116ea42c5502b.poster.avif?t=1764278695\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/69db785dc0c466dcf00116ea42c5502b.webm?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/69db785dc0c466dcf00116ea42c5502b.mp4?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engine Tech</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is powered by a custom ray tracing engine designed for fully dynamic lighting with pixel perfect shadows, reflections, and transparency. Combined with the destructible block-based environments, it creates a fully dynamic\u00a0 and visually stunning experience. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/a438bec2959ac3b20af0483229aefa90.poster.avif?t=1764278695\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/a438bec2959ac3b20af0483229aefa90.webm?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/a438bec2959ac3b20af0483229aefa90.mp4?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Asteroids</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated asteroids with labyrinthine tunnel systems and use them to infiltrate and escape enemy asteroid bases.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/8be114c2a042aa5b0ff08331934e7399.poster.avif?t=1764278695\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/8be114c2a042aa5b0ff08331934e7399.webm?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/8be114c2a042aa5b0ff08331934e7399.mp4?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Space Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space combat uses realistic Newtonian physics, with thrust, mass, and momentum shaping every manoeuvre. Thanks to the voxel-based design, enemy ships break apart realistically\u2014hit the hull and sections can shatter or detach during combat.  Switch seamlessly between controlling your ship and jetpacking towards an enemy base. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/d175ce1c1fb17ec7b726c0a427aba964.poster.avif?t=1764278695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/d175ce1c1fb17ec7b726c0a427aba964.webm?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/d175ce1c1fb17ec7b726c0a427aba964.mp4?t=1764278695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Strike13Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"